- [X] **Visual 2.2 (Regional Disparities):** Brazilian Map / Bar Chart comparing Southeast vs. North/Northeast delivery lead times and freight surcharges.
- [X] **Visual 2.3 (Shipping Burden):** Scatter plot or grouped bar of Freight Ratio vs. Review Score.
